yer tonight  for those parents  lying in bed and trying to figure out  will i be able to sleep again  what do i say to my other children  what happens tomorrow  may god bless the loss of innocent life  on this sad day  and may the lord be near the  brokenhearted  and save those  crushed in spirit  because they're going to need a lot of  help  a lot of our prayers  god love you

